  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * @brief Processing function for the Q31 RFFT/RIFFT.
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * @param[in]  *S    points to an instance of the Q31 RFFT/RIFFT structure.
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * @param[in]  *pSrc points to the input buffer.
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * @param[out] *pDst points to the output buffer.
  61:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * @return none.
  62:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** *
  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \par Input an output formats:
  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \par
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * Internally input is downscaled by 2 for every stage to avoid saturations inside CFFT/CIFFT proces
  66:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * Hence the output format is different for different RFFT sizes.
  67:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * The input and output formats for different RFFT sizes and number of bits to upscale are mentioned
  68:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \par
  69:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \image html RFFTQ31.gif "Input and Output Formats for Q31 RFFT"
  70:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** *
  71:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \par
  72:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** * \image html RIFFTQ31.gif "Input and Output Formats for Q31 RIFFT"
  73:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q31.c **** */
